{"id": "68820", "title": "唯情所愿", "author": "清水白", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 40, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68820.htm", "intro": "“我心本无主，明镜亦非台。”米萱，生如夏花的女子，如烈日般绚烂，“如果爱，请深爱；若放弃，请彻底。”\r\n\r\n纳兰淳于， 一个性格坚毅的男人，像罂粟般，食人心魄，一句：“黄土白骨，我守你一世温柔。”让她渐渐沦陷，他用他坚实的臂膀为她撑起一片天，一份温暖。\r\n\r\n当心里埋了一座坟，如何去破解？当心已被冰封，如何能消融？当爱情来临，我们该何去何从？\r\n\r\n与君初相识，犹如故人归。一个特种兵和一位医生的爱情故事，是缘，是命？是纠缠？琴瑟在即，莫不静好，此情应是长相守....", "base": "files/article/html/68/68820", "chapters": [{"title": "谁与争锋", "file": "10547598.html", "available": false}, {"title": "熙熙", "file": "10547599.html", "available": false}, {"title": "绝处", "file": "10547600.html", "available": false}, {"title": "逢生", "file": "10547601.html", "available": false}, {"title": "偶遇（修）", "file": "10547602.html", "available": false}, {"title": "借机（修）", "file": "10547603.html", "available": false}, {"title": "与君初相识", "file": "10547604.html", "available": false}, {"title": "与君初相识（二）", "file": "10547605.html", "available": false}, {"title": "闹曲", "file": "10547606.html", "available": false}, {"title": "错打", "file": "10547607.html", "available": false}, {"title": "情敌", "file": "10547608.html", "available": false}, {"title": "误会", "file": "10547609.html", "available": false}, {"title": "抉择（上）", "file": "10547610.html", "available": false}, {"title": "抉择（下）", "file": "10547611.html", "available": false}, {"title": "揭开", "file": "10547612.html", "available": false}, {"title": "情迷", "file": "10547613.html", "available": false}, {"title": "攻入", "file": "10547614.html", "available": false}, {"title": "沦陷", "file": "10547615.html", "available": false}, {"title": "拨开", "file": "10547616.html", "available": false}, {"title": "温情", "file": "10547617.html", "available": false}, {"title": "破茧", "file": "10547618.html", "available": false}, {"title": "情浓", "file": "10547619.html", "available": false}, {"title": "破晓(上）", "file": "10547620.html", "available": false}, {"title": "破晓（下）", "file": "10547621.html", "available": false